1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,757
The butterfly has become the thing her fans carry — the official symbol of a fandom that learned patience as a group activity.

2
00:00:07,757 --> 00:00:10,927
It fits, in a way that branding rarely does.

3
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:19,677
A thing that spends its early life unrecognizable from what it becomes, and arrives on the other side of the wait with entirely new wings.

4
00:00:19,677 --> 00:00:21,804
You can call that a metaphor if you like.

5
00:00:21,804 --> 00:00:24,626
Her fans call it a record of what actually happened.

